Guha offers soft bed and night watch for Rāma --- LakṣmaṆa refuses sleep while Rāma lies on ground --- Pities invincible prince couched on grass with Sītā --- Foretells king will not long survive exile --- Sees earth widowed and palace fallen silent --- Fears Kausalyā and Sumitrā may not live this night --- Mourns father dying unfulfilled without crowning Rāma --- Pictures lovely Ayōdhyā with highways music ruined --- Hopes to re-enter Ayōdhyā with Rāma after exile --- Guha sheds tears hearing truthful prince lament
